xt visit opens with what is still open, and a problem that was active last time is pointed out","Learns from the people who use it: corrections and ratings that three users agree on change how SCOPE reads similar notes, for everyone, without a new release"],"sourceUrl":"https://github.com/FabcanK6/scope/blob/main/README.md","fingerprint":"ac4621589a54d3b2d8299037a3e9bdaf3b7df121848d762ae87441145f0744cd","extractedAt":"2026-10-12T08:00:52.664Z"},"overviewCheckedAt":"2026-10-12T08:00:52.664Z","projectInsights":{"version":1,"whatItDoes":{"text":"SCOPE reads free-text clinical trial monitoring visit notes (formal visit reports, quick field notes, visit e-mails) and turns each one into a record anyone working on the study can act on:","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/FabcanK6/scope/blob/main/README.md"},"audience":[],"requirements":[],"fingerprint":"ac4621589a54d3b2d8299037a3e9bdaf3b7df121848d762ae87441145f0744cd","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/FabcanK6/scope/blob/main/README.md","checkedAt":"2026-10-12T08:00:52.665Z"},"overviewRepoUpdated":"2026-10-05T17:37:07Z","readmeSnapshot":{"version":1,"status":"saved","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/FabcanK6/scope/blob/main/README.md","checkedAt":"2026-10-12T08:00:52.666Z","hash":"ac4621589a54d3b2d8299037a3e9bdaf3b7df121848d762ae87441145f0744cd","originalBytes":32894,"storedBytes":32894,"truncated":false,"searchTerms":["notes","scope","visit","model","study","note","every","protocol","rules","only","app","each","risk","data","gemini","one","rubric","llm","key","free","own","when","finding","issue","site","findings","test","days","visits","what","quote","action","date","problem","profile","sae","any","open","studies","two","accuracy","code","consent","critical","practice","same","set","severity","shows","api","bert","default","demo","fictional","hand-written","items","low","next","python","report","rule","sentence","three","under","which","agree","calendar","community","dates","does","engine","once","people","reads","real","report